        "relationship_type": "related",
        "body": "The particle か can follow nouns to mean 'or,' clearly specifying alternatives (e.g., 今日か明日休みます = 'I'll take off today or tomorrow'). On the other hand, でも, which also follows nouns, means 'or something,' suggesting an open-ended alternative (e.g., お茶でも飲みましょうか = 'Shall we drink tea or something?').",
